[2026-02-02T19:46:31.169+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:46:31 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.parmatoday.it/eventi/il-jazz-contemporaneo-di-giacomo-papetti-a-sounds-stories-13547232.html>
{'category': [],
